pace 1

## SQ-GAP-04b | follow-up: recipes by result for powered rail, golden apple, golden carrot; nuggets and block recipe inputs; item storage tag
> zq itemtag forge:storage_blocks/gold
> zq makes minecraft:powered_rail
waitlog \[zq\] makes minecraft:powered_rail: \d+ 30
> zq makes minecraft:golden_apple
waitlog \[zq\] makes minecraft:golden_apple: \d+ 30
> zq makes minecraft:golden_carrot
waitlog \[zq\] makes minecraft:golden_carrot: \d+ 30
> zq rdetail powered_rail
> zq rdetail golden_apple
> zq rdetail golden_carrot
> zq rdetail minecraft:gold_ingot_from_nuggets
> zq rdetail minecraft:gold_block
> zq rdetail component_gold
waitlog \[zq\] rdetail matching component_gold: \d+ 30
> zq uses mca:rose_gold_nugget
waitlog \[zq\] uses mca:rose_gold_nugget: 60
look powered rail, golden apple, golden carrot: the gold input is a tag holding rose gold; gold_ingot_from_nuggets and minecraft:gold_block take literal gold only
